AB  - Recent advances in big data, learning analytics, and scalable architectures present new opportunities to redesign adaptive learning systems. This paper is part directional and part speculative. We sketch a possible future for designing next generation adaptive learning systems based on new developments in learning science and data science. © 2016, The Author(s).
