AB  - Learning difficulties among graduate students have always been greatest challenge. Learning analytics offers an evidence-based problem solving approach. In this context, eye-Tracking is a profound technology that captures real-Time eye gaze data of learners. This paper proposes a robust intelligent tutoring system based on the eye tracking data of learners. The system offers adaptive learning by providing customized feedback to learners. Learner-centered design approach has been followed throughout the development process. Measuring success, evaluation will be performed with real learners. © 2017 IEEE.
