AB  - For beginning programmers, understanding how to express instructions to the computer and organizing these instructions effectively remains a significant challenge. We propose an adaptive AI-guided learning system that personalizes code completion assistance based on individual student profiles. Our approach extends the traditional reverse code completion paradigm by incorporating dynamic hyperparameter adjustment, comprehensive learning analytics, and automated assessment of student progress. Through extensive experimentation across multiple programming concepts and problem types, we demonstrate significant improvements in learning outcomes and knowledge retention. Our results show that students using this adaptive system achieve higher success rates, produce more efficient code, and demonstrate better long-term retention of programming concepts compared to traditional teaching methods. © 2025 IEEE.
