AB  - This chapter examines the impact of digital transformation on education, focusing on how advanced technologies like Experience API (xAPI), Artificial Intelligence (AI), and serious games are reshaping distance learning. The xAPI is highlighted for its ability to capture detailed learning data, enhance learning analytics, and enable the creation of personalised reports and tracking of student progress. The integration of AI, including Machine Learning and NLP, is explored in the context of e-learning, showcasing its role in personalisation, real-time feedback, and intelligent tutoring systems. The chapter also delves into serious games, presenting their benefits for student engagement and motivation. The Framework for Adaptive Serious Games (F4ASG) is discussed, demonstrating how Learning Analytics and AI can enhance engagement and learning effectiveness. Finally, the chapter explores the integration of these technologies, providing practical insights, examples, and strategies for creating adaptive learning experiences in distance education. © 2025 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
